<title>USA: IPO FILING - Sun Hydraulics Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Sun Hydraulics Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		 Sun Hydraulics Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			SNHY.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $9.50-$11.50/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.0 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after IPO    6.0 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  300,000 shrs Business: The Sarasota, Fla., company is a designer and manufacturer of high-performance, screw-in hydraulic cartridge valves and manifolds which control force, speed and motion as integral components in fluid power system. Use of Proceeds: Includes repayment of debt related to equipment financing and mortgage financing of the existing and new Florida manufacturing plants and for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ende Dec 31:</p>
<p>				    1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $55,388	    $42,853</p>
<p>   - Net Income	     $8,861	     $5,403</p>
